'''Setsuko''' (せつ子) is an enemy appearing in [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nebaaru-kun & Nyan Puuzle]] Collaboration Event. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Setsuko
|appearance = [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 240.png
|money drop = 750円 - 2,962円
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with rather average health, damage and range as well as a 50% chance to knockback the player's [[Cat Units]]. This enemy also has Area Attack making its knockback slightly deadly.<br>
Since this cat only appears in one stage, there isn't much to fear about it.

==Strategy==
Units that outrange this cat can help very much, especially units that are [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|Immune to Knockback]] so that 50% proc chance will do absolutely nothing to them. However, its 6,000 damage will chip away your unit's health little by little, no matter how high level they are.

